    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hannezo-branching-random-walk-annihilation-measurement-3d-cylindrical-fat-pad-barw-topological-branching-fraction-q-branch-ecm-lambda-0-1> a schema:PropertyValue,
